\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.3}{\ignorespaces Quantization condition with~$\im  \hbar >0$ and $\im  E\lesssim 0$ for resonance. The red path on the left panel is a simple option to carry out the analytical continuation, along which we can expect the normalizability of the exact WKB solution. The right panel shows actual connection manipulations of it. The red solid line is on the Riemann sheet depicted and the red dashed line is on another Riemann sheet after passing through the branch cut; the red dotted curve is the analytical continuation at infinity. The nontrivial cycle, $A$-cycle, is shown as the green loop.}}{140}{figure.caption.32}\protected@file@percent }
