\newlabel{src:2512_24528:fig:theta_on_E}{{9.1}{255}{Schematic energy-plane picture of complex scaling. The complex-scaled continuum spectrum is rotated by $-2\theta $ (blue) from the positive real axis. We set $\theta _n<\theta <\theta _{n+1}$. Resonance poles at $\vsup {E_{n+1,n+2\dots }}{R}$ appear below the rotated cut, and Gamow states at $\vsup {E_{0,1,\dots ,n}}{R}$ become regularized as discrete states}{figure.caption.76}{}}
